---
title: Checkout flow
---
%% A Mermaid flowchart that exercises the supported subset and a few things that aren't.
flowchart LR
    user([Shopper]) -->|browse| web[Web storefront]
    web --> api{{API gateway}}
    api --> cart(Cart service) & orders[Order service]
    orders -.->|order placed| bus[(Event bus)]
    bus -.-> mailer>Email sender]
    orders ==> db[(Orders DB)]
    cart -- reads and writes --> cache[(Session cache)]
    api --- auth[/Auth check/]
    subgraph core [Core services]
        cart
        orders
    end
    subgraph data ["Data"]
        db
        subgraph hot [Hot data]
            cache
        end
    end
    click web "https://example.com" "Open"
    classDef svc fill:#eef,stroke:#88f
    class cart,orders svc
    style db fill:#ffe
    linkStyle 0 stroke:#f00
    api --x auth2[Legacy auth]:::old
    db ~~~ cache
    orders --> orders
    orders e5@--> api
